## Contract extension workflow

The selected business rule is to extend the existing contract.

When extending:
1. Open the active contract.
2. Enter the new return date.
3. Check availability.
4. Check for conflicts.
5. Recalculate the additional rental amount.
6. Recalculate mileage allowance when applicable.
7. Record additional payment or debt.
8. Create an extension history record.
9. Preserve the original terms.
10. Update the expected return date.

Keep every extension traceable.

