# 26. BUSINESS VALIDATION RULES

Implement these validations:

1. A vehicle cannot have overlapping active rentals.
2. A vehicle in maintenance cannot be rented.
3. An unavailable vehicle cannot be confirmed for rental.
4. Customer eligibility must be checked before contract confirmation.
5. Blacklisted customers require an authorized override.
6. Deposit and rental payment must remain separate.
7. A refund cannot exceed the eligible refundable amount.
8. Extra mileage cannot be negative.
9. Return odometer cannot be lower than departure odometer without an authorized correction.
10. Rental extensions must preserve their original contract history.
11. Payments cannot silently disappear after contract modification.
12. Expenses must have valid amounts and dates.
13. Inventory withdrawals cannot create negative quantities without authorized override.
14. Closed cash sessions cannot be silently modified.
15. All financial adjustments must be traceable.
